  "html": "<p>参考文章：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DWF8wt8SPcPqL2oNuYp1lg\"><span>2026 年计算机视觉技术全景：从 YOLO26、RF-DETR 到 DINOv3 与 SAM 3</span></a></p><h2>CV任务分类</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">CV 任务可归为六类：识别、几何、开放词汇与多模态、视频、生成，以及作为地基的</span><span><strong>表示学习</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">&nbsp;(representation learning)</span></p><table style=\"min-width: 480px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(201, 205, 212);\"><p><strong>类别 </strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(201, 205, 212);\"><p><strong>任务 </strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(201, 205, 212);\"><p><strong>输出 </strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(201, 205, 212);\"><p><strong>主流评测基准 </strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(201, 205, 212);\"><p><strong>代表模型 </strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>识别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>图像分类</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>类别标签</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ImageNet-1k、ImageNet-ReaL</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ViT、ConvNeXt</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>识别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>目标检测</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>水平框 + 类别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>COCO、Objects365、RF100-VL</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO 系列、RT-DETR、RF-DETR</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>识别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>旋转框检测 (OBB)</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>带角度的框</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DOTA</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO11/26-OBB</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>识别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>语义 / 实例 / 全景分割</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>像素级掩码</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ADE20K、COCO、Cityscapes</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Mask2Former、SAM 系列</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>识别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>姿态 / 关键点</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>关键点坐标</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>COCO-Keypoints</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO-Pose、RTMPose</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>识别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>多目标跟踪</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>带 ID 的轨迹</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>MOT17、DanceTrack</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ByteTrack、BoT-SORT</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>识别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>OCR / 文档解析</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>文本 + 版面结构</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>OmniDocBench 等</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>PaddleOCR、各类 OCR-VLM</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>几何</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>单目深度估计</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>深度图</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>NYU-Depth v2、KITTI</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Depth Anything 系列</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>几何</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>特征匹配 / 3D 重建</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>对应点、点云、场景</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ScanNet、MegaDepth</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>LightGlue、DUSt3R、3D Gaussian Splatting</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>开放词汇</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>文本指定检测 / 分割</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>框或掩码</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>LVIS、ODinW</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Grounding DINO、YOLO-World、YOLOE</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>多模态</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>视觉问答 / 图文理解</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>文本</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>MMMU、DocVQA</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>CLIP/SigLIP 编码器 + LLM</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>视频</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>动作识别、视频分割</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>标签、时序掩码</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Kinetics、DAVIS</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>VideoMAE、SAM 2</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>生成</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>图像 / 视频生成与编辑</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>图像、视频</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>FID、人评</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>扩散模型、DiT</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>表示学习</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>自监督预训练</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>通用特征</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>线性探针、kNN、密集任务探针</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DINOv2/v3、MAE</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>主流架构</h2><table style=\"min-width: 480px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>发布</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>架构</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>家族</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>核心设计特征</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>许可证</strong></span></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025-11</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>SAM 3 (</span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.16719\"><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.16719</span></a><span>)</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>分割基础模型</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>文本/示例提示的概念分割；检测器与视频跟踪器共享 backbone；presence head 解耦识别与定位</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>SAM License（自定义）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2026-01（2025-09 公布）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO26 (</span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.25164\"><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.25164</span></a><span>)</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO（Ultralytics）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>原生无 NMS、移除 DFL、ProgLoss + STAL、MuSGD 优化器，面向 CPU/边缘</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>AGPL-3.0 / 商业授权</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025-09</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DEIMv2 (</span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://github.com/Intellindust-AI-Lab/DEIMv2\"><span>https://github.com/Intellindust-AI-Lab/DEIMv2</span></a><span>)</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DETR 实时</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DINOv3 特征 + DEIM 训练框架，含超轻量变体</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Apache-2.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025-08</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DINOv3 (</span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10104\"><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10104</span></a><span>)</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>自监督 backbone</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>7B 教师、约 17 亿张图、Gram anchoring，蒸馏出 ViT 与 ConvNeXt</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DINOv3 License（自定义）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025-06</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv13</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO（学术）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>超图高阶相关模块 HyperACE、全流程特征分发 FullPAD、深度可分离卷积</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>AGPL-3.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025-03</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>RF-DETR (</span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://github.com/roboflow/rf-detr\"><span>https://github.com/roboflow/rf-detr</span></a><span>)</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DETR 实时</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DINOv2 backbone + 可变形 DETR 解码器 + 权重共享 NAS</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Apache-2.0（XL/2XL 另有许可）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025-02</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv12 (</span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.12524\"><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.12524</span></a><span>)</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO（学术）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>以注意力为中心：Area Attention、R-ELAN、FlashAttention</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>AGPL-3.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2024-12</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DEIM</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DETR 训练框架</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Dense O2O 匹配 + Matchability-Aware Loss，加速收敛</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Apache-2.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2024-10</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>D-FINE</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DETR 实时</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>把框回归改为概率分布的细粒度迭代修正</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Apache-2.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2024-09</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO11</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO（Ultralytics）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>C3k2、SPPF、C2PSA（深层注意力）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>AGPL-3.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2024-05</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv10</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO（学术）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>一致双重分配实现无 NMS；PSA 模块</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>AGPL-3.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2023-12</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DINOv2 + registers</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>自监督 backbone</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>1.42 亿张精选图、iBOT + DINO 损失、register token 去伪影</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Apache-2.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2023-04</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>RT-DETR</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DETR 实时</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>CNN backbone + 只在最高层做自注意力的混合编码器</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Apache-2.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2023-01</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv8</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO（Ultralytics）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>C2f、anchor-free、解耦头</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>AGPL-3.0</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>架构里的模块</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">CV检测器模型可以拆成六个部位：backbone、neck、注意力插件、检测头、训练监督 (损失 + 标签分配)、优化器。后续的很多模型都是不同论文里的特色模块的替换或者拼接，比如把backbone换成RepVGG。</span></p><table style=\"min-width: 384px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>部位</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>代表模块</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>解决什么问题</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>典型出处</strong></span></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Backbone：卷积块</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>残差块、深度可分离卷积、CSP、ELAN、C2f、C3k2、RepVGG 重参数化</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>在有限算力下提取特征并保持梯度流</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ResNet、MobileNet、YOLOv4–v11</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Backbone：Transformer</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ViT 块（多头自注意力 + MLP）、窗口注意力、register token</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>全局建模、随数据规模扩展</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ViT、Swin、DINOv2/v3</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>池化</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>SPP / SPPF、全局平均池化、CLS token</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>扩大感受野；把特征图汇成向量</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv3 起至 YOLO26；分类头</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>Neck：多尺度融合</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>FPN、PANet、BiFPN、RT-DETR 混合编码器</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>让大物体与小物体都有合适分辨率的特征</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>几乎所有检测器</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>注意力插件</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>SE、CBAM、PSA、C2PSA、Area Attention（A2）、可变形注意力</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>在卷积网络中引入全局或重点区域信息</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv10/11/12、Deformable DETR</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>检测头</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>anchor-free 解耦头、DETR 查询解码器、presence head</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>把特征变成框与类别</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv8+、DETR 系、SAM 3</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>后处理</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>NMS；一对一匹配（无 NMS）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>去除重复框</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>传统 YOLO；DETR、YOLOv10、YOLO26</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>回归损失</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>IoU 系列（GIoU/DIoU/CIoU）、DFL、D-FINE 的细粒度分布修正</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>让框更准</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv8–v11 用 DFL；YOLO26 移除</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>标签分配</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>SimOTA、TAL、STAL；匈牙利匹配、Dense O2O</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>决定哪些预测负责哪个真值</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOX、YOLOv8、YOLO26；DETR、DEIM</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>优化器</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>SGD、AdamW、MuSGD（SGD + Muon）</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>训练稳定性与收敛速度</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO26 引入 MuSGD</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>归一化 / 位置编码</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>BN（CNN）、LN（ViT）；绝对位置编码、RoPE、用 7×7 卷积代替位置编码</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>训练稳定；让注意力感知空间位置</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv12 去掉位置编码；DINOv3 用 RoPE</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>模块的历史演变</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">十年演变可以概括为一句话：卷积负责“便宜且可靠”，注意力负责“全局且可扩展”，工程约束（延迟、导出、量化）决定两者在网络中各占多少</span></p><table style=\"min-width: 288px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 96px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>年份</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>节点</strong></span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240);\"><p><span><strong>为什么被采纳</strong></span></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLO26：移除 DFL、原生无 NMS、MuSGD</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>边缘部署：简化导出图、稳定 INT8；LLM 训练技术回流</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DINOv3：Gram anchoring；DEIMv2/RF-DETR 接入 DINO backbone</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>基础模型特征足够强，检测器只需轻量头</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2025</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv12：Area Attention + FlashAttention</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>注意力的内存访问瓶颈被 FlashAttention 缓解</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2024</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv10：一致双重分配、PSA；YOLO11：C2PSA</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>去掉 NMS 带来的延迟波动；低成本引入全局信息</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2023</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>RT-DETR：混合编码器；DINOv2 + registers</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>DETR 首次实时；自监督特征可直接冻结使用</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2023</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOv8：C2f、anchor-free 解耦头、DFL</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>省去锚框调参，定位更准，易用生态</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2021–22</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>YOLOX anchor-free + SimOTA；RepVGG 重参数化；TOOD 的 TAL</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>训练时多分支、推理时合并为单卷积，GPU 友好</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2020–21</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>ViT、DETR、Deformable DETR、Swin</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>注意力进入视觉；二分匹配证明检测可以端到端</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2019–20</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>CSPNet、EfficientDet 的 BiFPN、YOLOv4/v5、SPPF</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>减少重复梯度、降低计算；多尺度融合更高效</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2017–18</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>FPN、PANet、SE、CBAM、MobileNet 深度可分离卷积</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>多尺度检测；廉价的通道/空间注意力；移动端可用</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>2014–16</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>SPP、ResNet 残差、YOLOv1 单阶段检测</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>任意输入尺寸；极深网络可训练；实时检测成为可能</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
}